NAK (NVK shader compiler) changes from ChanseyIsTheBest/mesa-switch, branch
unleashedrecomp-driver (acc21efd nfsmw-nx + 1e47a108 UnleashedRecomp), compiler
files only, for mesa-switch 26.2.4 (danfromtico 0ff52079):
- branch flattening (nir_opt_peephole_select limit 0 -> 8),
- scheduler latencies 200 cycles (NAK_TEX_LATENCY/NAK_MEM_LATENCY/NAK_ATTR_LATENCY),
- Maxwell operand reuse (NAK_DEBUG=noreuse turns it off),
- FADD32I saturation fix.
The driver-side half of that branch (ZCULL, Horizon and draw-path changes) does not
apply to 26.2.4 and is not included. Used by tools/switch/Dockerfile.nak.

